      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "Creatures killed by a sojiruh are difficult to bring back to life or animate as undead. The sojiruh automatically attempts to counteract|CRB|3|counteracting|0 any attempt to resurrect or animate any creature that it has killed (counteract modifier +11, counteract level 2). If the sojiruh who slew the creature is itself slain, the creature can be brought back from death or become undead normally."
